            "Fixed ☉ Λ → ☉ const in assertions.sg, test_fixtures.sg, test_harness.sg",
            "Fixed :: → · (Rust to Sigil path separator) in mixer_integration.sg, test_fixtures.sg",
            "Fixed #[track_caller] → //@ rune: track_caller in assertions.sg",
            "Fixed #[should_panic(...)] → //@ rune: should_panic(...) in assertions.sg",
            "Fixed ⌛ → ⟳ (hourglass to loop symbol) in test_fixtures.sg",
            "Simplified test_large_project() to avoid array[variable] parser limitation",
            "All 8 test files now pass sigil check",
            "Drafted SIGIL-TEST-RUNTIME.md spec (in-source tests, attributes, array indexing)",
        ]!,
        current: "Syntax fixes complete. Runtime spec drafted. Tests await parser updates."~,
        blocked_by: "sigil test expects tests/*.sigil, not src-sg/tests/*.sg pattern"?,
        discoveries: [
            "☉ const NAME: Type = value; is correct (not ☉ Λ)",
            "· (middledot) is path separator (not ::)",
            "//@ rune: X is attribute syntax (not #[X])",
            "⟳ is while loop (not ⌛)",
            "Parser v0.4.0-rc.4 has array[variable] limitation - workaround needed",
            "sigil test runner expects tests/*.sigil structure, not in-source scroll tests",
        ]!,
        next_steps: [
            "Submit SIGIL-TEST-RUNTIME.md for parser/runtime team review",
            "Await parser update for array indexing support",
            "Consider tests/*.sigil adapter if runtime changes not feasible",
        ]~,
    },

