        susceptibility: 0.5~, // Ready for external collaboration
    },

    reflection: "All 8 test files (127 test functions) now pass syntax validation. The sigil test runner needs enhancements to support in-source test modules. Created SIGIL-TEST-RUNTIME.md spec with requirements: in-source discovery, attributes, array indexing. Parser limitations are documented with workarounds applied."~,
